# trace-boardviewer
===
 Free, open-source boardviewer for electronics repair. Open boardview/PCB files beside schematics, PDFs and images offline. KiCad, EAGLE, selected Allegro/Altium layouts, EasyEDA Pro, scanned-PDF OCR and in-app bug reports. Stable 1.3.3: Windows x64; experimental macOS Apple silicon and Linux x86-64.
